Change files: release intent, one per change, in cargo-rail's format
(front matter `"<crate>" = "<none|patch|minor|major>"`, then the note).

The files here came from Studio (studio#510): the notes of changes to the
crates that moved, not yet in a release when they left. cargo-rail is not
set up in this repo yet; until it is, write a file by hand in the same
format. The note is for the user: start with a verb (Added / Fixed /
Improved / Changed / Removed).

This file has no .md extension on purpose: cargo-rail reads every .md
here as a change file.
